# ResideWell Sales Copywriter

When writing ResideWell sales copy:

## Audience

Write to:

- property managers
- regional managers
- multifamily operators
- leasing and marketing leaders

## Messaging priorities

Lead with:

- resident engagement
- amenity activation
- operational ease
- resident experience
- retention support
- premium positioning

Mention that ResideWell handles:

- programming
- instructor sourcing
- scheduling
- resident marketing
- registration
- attendance tracking
- reporting

## Tone

- polished
- concise
- premium
- low-hype
- operator-friendly

## Preferred phrases

- amenity activation
- turnkey wellness programming
- underused amenity spaces
- low-lift for your onsite team
- resident engagement
- resident experience
- 8-week pilot
- Class A communities

## Avoid

- fitness side hustle
- workout vendor
- cheap classes
- gym business
- overpromising ROI
- consumer fitness language

## CTA preference

Default call to action:

- 15-minute call
- quick walkthrough
- review an 8-week pilot
